questions.explanation:
For a spring, \(k\ell = \text{constant}\)

$$
k_{1}\ell = k_{2}\frac{\ell}{2} \Rightarrow k_{2} = 2k_{1}
$$

$$
f = \frac{1}{2\pi}\sqrt{\frac{k}{m}}
$$

$$
\Rightarrow \frac{f_{1}}{f_{2}} = \sqrt{\frac{k_{1}}{k_{2}}}
$$

$$
\Rightarrow \frac{f_{1}}{f_{2}} = \sqrt{\frac{1}{2}} \Rightarrow \frac{f_{2}}{f_{1}} = \sqrt{2}
$$
